    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d408">

                <pb facs="0562" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg548"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC Indonesia/12–1148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Batavia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Livengood</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d408-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Batavia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-11T15:00:00+08:00">December 11,
                            1948—3 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1082. Gocus 479. Following text Netherlands Delegation letter 3824 dated December
                    11 from Schuurman to GOC handed by Schuurman <pb facs="0563" n="549"
                        xml:id="pg549"/> to Cochran noon December 11: [Here follows text printed in
                    SC, <hi rendition="#italic">3rd yr., Suppl</hi>. (Dec.), page 150.]</p>
                <p> GOC drafting its telegraphic report to SC with which foregoing will be
                        included.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d408-f2"/> Will report exact hour sent which
                    will be not later than December 13. Signed Cochran.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Livengood</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d408-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d408-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated in telegram 622, December 13, 8 p. m., to The Hague.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d408-f2" n="2" xml:id="d408-f2-content">
                <p>The report was transmitted in telegram 1083, December 12, from Batavia (Gocus
                    480); for text, see SC, <hi rendition="#italic">3rd yr., Suppl</hi>. (Dec.), p.
                    122.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
